Package: spac3tools
Type: Package
Title: tools for spacial gen3sis input objects gen3sis.
Version: 0.1.0
Author: c(person("rf-gem3sis team", role=c("cph"), comment = "sfo Oskar Hagen"),
          person("Oskar", "Hagen", email = "oskar@hagen.bio", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = "Centre for Integrative Biodiversity Research (iDiv) Halle-Jena-Leipzig")
          )
Maintainer: The package maintainer <oskar@hagen.bio>
Description: set of tools to create, converte, compress and decompress files containing spatial and temporal environmental data, stored as space.rds (rf-gen3sis) or landscape.rds (gen3sis) input data. This package supports input in the format of a gen3sis landscape.rds or a rf-gen3sis space.rds, converting in bouth directions with 'landscape_to_space' or 'space_to_landscape'. compressing and decompressing only works with gen3sis_space objects. Thus, gen3sis_space decompressed objects are ready to be simulated with gen3sis branch rf-gen3sis at TODO_LINKHERE_TO_REP. Note that if you want to use a gen3sis_space object, you should remember to additionally, use the convert function 'space_to_landscape' from spac3tools before using it as a gen3sis input landscape.
